f22 = "TestRepairM_943_f22_RefusalNetwork: exact returned malformed/negative/overflow liability errors through the real BaseApp ABCI encoder, loopback JSON-RPC and registered client error decoder, preserving the entire source and committed stores; retains TestQueryFeeAccountingRefusals."
f08 = "TestRepairM_943_f08_ViewsUnderActualPoolLock: TestViewsAnswerUnderLock now locks the nonzero PoolAddress matching the registered surface and metadata, checks that pool's EVM views, refuses reentry and retains separate-context lock reset assertions."
