wiring_request_1 = "modules/launchpad/client/cli/proof_module_cli_test.go, owning domain fm-launchpad (4): update the f18 expected FeeAccountingInfo to include seeded pool, epoch and claim counts."
wiring_request_2 = "modules/launchpad/types/proof_launchpad_errors_test.go, owning domain fm-launchpad (4): update the GetQuoteLedger overflow producer expectation to launchpad's registered code now that its owning getLedgerAmount wrapper supports SDK Cause traversal."
gotcha_1 = "The in-process QueryServiceTestHelper propagates Go errors without BaseApp's ABCI encoder; the repair gate therefore also uses a committed BaseApp store and the production network codecs."
gotcha_2 = "Migration writes airdrop claims independently of normal payouts and genesis import; that producer must maintain the same claim count."
gotcha_3 = "Repository graph context was stale and referenced unrelated work; the task's explicit paths, current working-tree diff and declared gate remained authoritative."
repair_cycle_1 = "The first verification exposed the fixture's unsupported legacy versioned store, SDK Wrapf stack frames that violated retained exact-error assertions, and a deep-equality distinction between two big.Int zero representations; the fixture now uses real PaxDB, the owning overflow wrapper implements both Cause and Unwrap while preserving its original message and identity, and the lock proof funds the real pool before asserting its reserve."
