continued_path = "TotalLiabilities and RecordFee both use key 0x49 and unscaled sdk.Int amounts; the f07 proof now drives the real Router.buy EVM handler, retains db.Ctx(), and checks the producer liabilities before network publication as well as the network and export consumers."
gotcha_6 = "The historical store ApplyChangesetAsync enqueues even with AsyncWriteBuffer 0; BaseApp.Commit can return before versioned query state is readable, so the loopback publisher asserts its persisted version watermark and exact committed store before querying."
