continuation_3 = "Reviewed the inherited producer and consumer: RecordFee and TotalLiabilities share key 0x49 with unscaled sdk.Int amounts; retained Router.buy handler coverage and added an exact per-buy liability delta plus point-read checks of every committed key before network publication."
continuation_3_failure = "Candidate 736ab02f20b3e2f00f58234f1627ed65badc981a: hf-done exited 1, /out/logs/verify-1.log; f07, f22 and f08 passed, while f06's committed-store equality caught an empty historical store despite its latest-version watermark."
continuation_3_repair = "BaseApp.Commit first flushes data in GetWorkingHash, then its empty commit flush advances the historical watermark before background ingestion completes; the publisher now waits for exact complete versioned data within the same five-second bound, retaining every equality and point-read assertion."
